OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GGreat concert performances from
OL,11,     Garound the world, including the
OL,12,     GBBC National Orchestra of Wales
OL,13,     Gwith Beethoven, chamber music
OL,14,     Gfrom Birmingham and live piano
OL,15,     Gmusic from Wigmore Hall.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Erik
OL,17,     FChisholm
OL,18,     GKate Molleson, with Dr John
OL,19,     GPurser, traces Chisholm's early
OL,20,     Glife, folk inspirations and first
OL,21,     Gsteps in music.
