OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,6,     Gfrom pianist Alexandra Dariescu,
OL,7,     Gplus writer Susan Wokoma talks
OL,8,     Gabout the new musical 'Handel and
OL,9,     GHendrix'.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GLudovic Morlot conducts the
OL,15,     GBournemouth Symphony Orchestra in
OL,16,     GSpanish music including Ravel's
OL,17,     Giconic Bolero and de Falla's
OL,18,     GNights in the Gardens of Spain
OL,19,     Gwith Steven Osborne.
